<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - JDN Realty raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - JDN Realty raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Friday it had raised its rating for JDN Realty Corp to near-term buy from near-term accumulate and to long-term buy from long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 25-7/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
